@startuml
skinparam dpi 180
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false

title Activity Diagram WF-02 - Historical Document OCR Ingestion, RAG Indexing & Local Content Approval

|Teacher / Content Admin|
start
:Create HistoricalContext or Character profile\n(status = DRAFT);
:Upload reference PDF / Markdown document\nand attach GeoJSON MapPins / 3D Model;

|Core Backend & AI Service|
:Classify uploaded PDF (Digital vs. Scanned);
if (Scanned PDF?) then (Yes)
    :Run Tess4J Vietnamese OCR extraction;
else (No)
    :Extract text via Apache PDFBox;
endif
:Save Document (status = ACTIVE) in PostgreSQL;
:Send extracted content to FastAPI AI Service;
:Execute dynamic 80th-percentile Semantic Chunking\nand generate 768-D BGE-M3 embeddings;
:Batch insert vectors into Supabase PgVector (vector_chunk);

|Teacher / Content Admin|
if (Global or School Local Content?) then (Global Content - Content Admin)
    :Publish directly (contentStatus = ACTIVE, isPublished = true);
    stop
else (School Local Content - Teacher)
    :Assign Local Content to Classroom(s)\nand submit for review (contentStatus = PENDING_REVIEW);
endif

|School Admin|
:Review pending Local Content & historical sources;
if (Approve Local Content?) then (Approved)
    :Set contentStatus = ACTIVE, isPublished = true;
    :Content becomes visible to enrolled School Students;
else (Rejected)
    :Set contentStatus = DRAFT with reviewNote feedback;
endif
stop
@enduml
